# Known differences between Plan R and plan9port, one to a line:
# script  stream (stdout, stderr or status)  why
syntax     stderr  plan9port's parser (2020) words errors and counts lines its own way; ours is Plan 9's
waitstatus stdout  plan9port's statuses are Unix exit codes, not wait messages
oserrors   stderr  the system's error strings are Unix's on plan9port
usage      stderr  plan9port's usage line has its debugging flags, -DSY
